{
 "about": "The subject a token yields: subject.id of the suite's service account parity-m2m, whose token has no client_id, alone in Authorization and under Authorization-Type: anonymous. No realm change: subjectClaims stops a request whose token carries client_id or another preferred_username.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_",
